<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="sq">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#0b1511">
  <meta name="description" content="MIZAN – Bëje veprën. Harroje emrin.">
  <link rel="manifest" href="manifest.json">

  <title>MIZAN</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      background: #07110d;
      color: #f3f1e8;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    header {
      padding: 30px 20px 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 38px;
      font-weight: bold;
      letter-spacing: 5px;
    }

    .subtitle {
      color: #a9b5ad;
      margin-top: 8px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 15px;
      padding-bottom: 100px;
    }

    .welcome {
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #10231b, #0b1813);
      border: 1px solid #263c31;
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .welcome h2 {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .welcome p {
      color: #aebbb3;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .tree-box {
      text-align: center;
      background: #0d1c15;
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 25px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      border: 1px solid #263c31;
    }

    #tree {
      font-size: 90px;
      margin: 15px 0;
      transition: 0.3s;
    }

    .progress {
      height: 10px;
      background: #1b2c24;
      border-radius: 20px;
      overflow: hidden;
      margin-top: 15px;
    }

    #progressBar {
      height: 100%;
      width: 0%;
      background: #d4af37;
      transition: 0.4s;
    }

    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .card {
      background: #0d1c15;
      border: 1px solid #263c31;
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 20px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: 0.2s;
    }

    .card:active {
      transform: scale(0.97);
    }

    .icon {
      font-size: 30px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .card h3 {
      margin-bottom: 5px;
    }

    .card p {
      color: #9daaa2;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .secret {
      margin-top: 18px;
      background: #111d18;
      border: 1px solid #4b4030;
      border-radius: 22px;
      padding: 22px;
    }

    .secret h3 {
      color: #d4af37;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    button {
      width: 100%;
      margin-top: 15px;
      padding: 14px;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: #d4af37;
      color: #101510;
      font-weight: bold;
      font-size: 15px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .counter {
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 15px;
      color: #c4cec8;
    }

    nav {
      position: fixed;
      bottom: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      background: #09130f;
      border-top: 1px solid #24372e;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-around;
      padding: 12px 5px;
    }

    nav button {
      background: transparent;
      color: #9eaaa3;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 5px;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    nav button:first-child {
      color: #d4af37;
    }

    @media (max-width: 380px) {
      .grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <div class="logo">MIZAN</div>
  <div class="subtitle">Bëje veprën. Harroje emrin.</div>
</header>

<div class="container">

  <section class="welcome">
    <h2>السلام عليكم 🌙</h2>
    <p>
      Çdo ditë është një mundësi për t'u afruar më shumë me Allahun.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="tree-box">
    <h3>Pema ime 🌳</h3>

    <div id="tree">🌱</div>

    <p id="treeText">Fillo me një vepër të mirë sot.</p>

    <div class="progress">
      <div id="progressBar"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="counter">
      <span id="points">0</span> vepra të regjistruara
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="grid">

    <div class="card" onclick="addGoodDeed()">
      <div class="icon">❤️</div>
      <h3>Vepër e mirë</h3>
      <p>Regjistro një vepër të mirë.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card" onclick="dhikr()">
     
